    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7a7ad1a3-7933-51e5-a1c6-c0092bc35cab" activityNameId="26507c5f-1c7d-5ea6-9472-bef1dae02653" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">3kWp slanted-roof installation, single-Si, laminated, integrated, on roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 3kWp slanted-roof installation, single-Si, laminated, integrated, on roof
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 3kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in China. The efficiency of single-Si PV modules is 17.9% (Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report 2019). The share of rejected or replaced PV modules is estimated at 3%. The inverter is assumed to be replaced once during the service life of the PV system.;
Synonyms: monocrystalline, single crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: a18a36fd-d1e1-306f-9285-16d783589b29
All components for the installation of a 3kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials and persons to the construction place. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in China.
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: Average module efficiency in 2018.
Production volume: Total installed capacity in 2018: approximately 175 GWp in China.
Sampling: Publication for efficiency, mounting systems and own estimations for other components. 
Extrapolations: Estimations for lifetime of PV modules (30a) and inverters (15a) as well as for transport distances. Modules are assumed to be produced in China.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a18a36fd-d1e1-306f-9285-16d783589b29.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
